  "description": "Three workouts a week for 8 weeks with kettlebells alone: swings, cleans, presses, snatches, squats, get-ups and carries. The program starts with one moderate bell and moves to a heavier one for the last block; with one bell, do the two-handed exercises holding it by the horns. Learn the swing well before the snatch. Exercises marked optional add arms, shoulders, calves or abs for a longer day; leave them out when short of time.",
